00:07:41,210 --> 00:07:43,960
And of course, we need to also the destructure it then,

134
00:07:46,140 --> 00:07:47,673
logging into the Console.

135
00:07:48,780 --> 00:07:50,513
But now we get some error here.

136
00:07:52,090 --> 00:07:54,760
So let's just take a look at the result itself

137
00:07:54,760 --> 00:07:56,333
without any destructuring.

138
00:07:57,220 --> 00:07:59,790
Oh, and so now it works.

